[x] A package-script call to an unreachable URL exited non-zero in 4.772 s\n+      without printing the credential.\n+\n+All successful, repeated, unauthorized, and failed-control runs completed under\n+the 30-second bound. Credentials were supplied only through environment\n+variables and are not recorded here.\n+\n+## Persistence And Multiple Instances\n+\n+- [x] Three API processes on ports 3000, 3001, and 3002 used the same\n+      authoritative PostgreSQL database.\n+- [x] A disable issued to port 3000 produced revision `16`; all three public\n+      `/v1/app-config` endpoints returned\n+      `features.referralProgramEnabled=false` within 4.685 s.\n+- [x] All three API processes were stopped and restarted. Every instance still\n+      returned `false`, proving the persisted state survived a complete process\n+      restart.\n+- [x] An enable issued to port 3001 produced revision `17`; all three public\n+      endpoints returned `true` within 2.507 s.\n+- [x] The local environment was left with the referral feature enabled.\n+\n+## Registration And Recovery\n+\n+- [x] `referral-registration.integration-spec.ts`: 9 tests passed against\n+      PostgreSQL and Redis, covering enabled registration, disabled registration,\n+      invalid/self referral, replay, and concurrent completion.\n+- [x] `referral-recovery.integration-spec.ts`: 9 tests passed, covering paused\n+      delivery while disabled, safe resume, and exactly-once inviter delivery.\n+- [x] `referral-repository.integration-spec.ts`: 3 tests passed, including 100\n+      disable/enable cycles with preserved codes, relationships, entitlements,\n+      wallet operations, history, and totals.\n+- [x] `referral-concurrency.integration-spec.ts`: 3 tests passed for competing\n+      registration/flag transitions without duplicate relationships or bonuses.\n+- [x] `wallet-credit-concurrency.integration-spec.ts`: 2 tests passed for the\n+      wallet idempotency/race boundary.\n+- [x] The registration assertions