disable/enable cycles.\n+- [x] Referral concurrency acceptance: 3 tests passed.\n+- [x] Wallet credit concurrency acceptance: 2 tests passed.\n+- [x] `pnpm db:migrate`: all six local migrations applied; no pending migration\n+      remained in the disposable/local development database.\n+\n+## Result\n+\n+The Phase 8 backend validation gate passes locally. This result does not replace\n+the shared-environment T073 approval, drain evidence, or post-application row\n+counts required by `rollout-readiness.md`.\n*** Update File: /Users/k1t94/Work/Projects/kaynann/knn-water-machine/specs/005-referral-program/checklists/mobile-visual.md\n@@\n-**Prepared**: 2026-08-10\n+**Prepared**: 2026-08-13\n@@\n-- [x] Referral, apply-code, navigation, and deep-link tests pass.\n-- [x] Complete mobile test suite passes: 28 files, 113 tests.\n+- [x] Complete mobile test suite passes: 30 files, 126 tests.\n - [x] Mobile TypeScript typecheck passes.\n-- [x] Mobile ESLint passes with zero warnings.\n - [x] Expo production JS export succeeds for iOS and Android.\n-- [x] Tests reject mockup-only 20 L, full names, reward-after-purchase wording,\n-      sample data, and automatic promo application.\n+- [x] Static navigation regression tests prove `ApplyReferralCodeScreen` and its\n+      route are absent from production mobile source.\n+- [x] Availability, registration, deep-link, referral-store, navigation, and\n+      screen tests cover unknown/disabled UI hiding, signed-in link rejection,\n+      pending-code clearing, stale request cancellation, and enabled sharing.\n+- [x] The mockup was inspected for hierarchy and visual direction. Its obsolete\n+      apply-code/purchase eligibility and illustrative data were not restored.\n - [x] A 250-row privacy-safe invitation history renders without exposing full\n       phone numbers.\n@@\n-- [x] Phone-width loading, empty, loaded, refresh, error, and pagination states\n+- [ ] Phone-width loading, empty, loaded, refresh, error, and pagination stat