2026-08-13T15:52:26.486721Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019ffbb6-7fc2-7180-9886-d34c68354dde}:submission_dispatch{otel.name="op.dispatch.user_input" submission.id="019ffbcc-09b3-7e70-8ca4-8a0ff5ee3455" codex.op="user_input"}:turn{otel.name="session_task.turn" thread.id=019ffbb6-7fc2-7180-9886-d34c68354dde turn.id=019ffbcc-09b3-7e70-8ca4-8a0ff5ee3455 model=gpt-5.6-sol codex.turn.reasoning_effort=medium}: codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec const patch = "*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/contracts/machine-discovery.openapi.yaml\n+openapi: 3.1.0\n+info:\n+  title: Machine Discovery API\n+  version: 1.0.0\n+  description: >-\n+    Authenticated consumer-safe machine discovery, exact identifier resolution,\n+    and read-only selection revalidation. No operation creates a purchase,\n+    reservation, wallet transaction, dispense session, or machine command.\n+servers:\n+  - url: http://localhost:3000\n+security:\n+  - bearerAuth: []\n+paths:\n+  /api/v1/machines:\n+    get:\n+      operationId: discoverMachines\n+      summary: Discover a bounded deterministic page of public machines\n+      parameters:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Limit'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Cursor'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Latitude'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Longitude'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/North'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/East'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/South'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/West'\n+      responses:\n+        '200':\n+          description: Public catalog page\n+          content:\n+            application/json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineCatalogPage'\n+        '400':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/ValidationError'\n+        '401':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/AuthenticationError'\n+        '409':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/DiscoveryContextStale'\n+        '503':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/TemporaryUnavailable'\n+  /api/v1/machines/{machineId}:\n+    get:\n+      operationId: getMachineDetail\n+      summary: Refresh one public machine card\n+      parameters:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/MachineId'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Latitude'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Longitude'\n+      responses:\n+        '200':\n+          description: Fresh allowlisted machine detail\n+          content:\n+            application/json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineDetail'\n+        '400':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/ValidationError'\n+        '401':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/AuthenticationError'\n+        '404':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/MachineNotFound'\n+        '503':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/TemporaryUnavailable'\n+  /api/v1/machines/resolve:\n+    post:\n+      operationId: resolveMachineIdentifier\n+      summary: Resolve a supported QR payload or manual code exactly\n+      requestBody:\n+        required: true\n+        content:\n+          application/json:\n+            schema:\n+              $ref: '#/components/schemas/ResolveMachineRequest'\n+      responses:\n+        '200':\n+          description: Fresh allowlisted detail for the exact public match\n+          content:\n+            application/json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineDetail'\n+        '400':\n+          description: Invalid, ambiguous, or unsupported input syntax/scheme\n+          content:\n+            application/problem+json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+              examples:\n+                invalidCode:\n+                  value:\n+                    code: MACHINE_CODE_INVALID\n+                    message: The machine code format is not supported.\n+                    retryable: false\n+                    correlationId: 01JEXAMPLE0000000000000000\n+        '401':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/AuthenticationError'\n+        '404':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/MachineNotFound'\n+        '503':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/TemporaryUnavailable'\n+  /api/v1/machines/{machineId}/selection-revalidation:\n+    post:\n+      operationId: revalidateMachineSelection\n+      summary: Revalidate current price and eligibility for typed handoff\n+      parameters:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/MachineId'\n+      requestBody:\n+        required: true\n+        content:\n+          application/json:\n+            schema:\n+              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SelectionRevalidationRequest'\n+      responses:\n+        '200':\n+          description: Current eligible context; no purchase side effect occurred\n+          content:\n+            application/json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineSelectionHandoff'\n+        '400':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/ValidationError'\n+        '401':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/AuthenticationError'\n+        '404':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/MachineNotFound'\n+        '409':\n+          description: >-\n+            Selection-relevant context changed. The client must display the\n+            returned fresh detail and require a new explicit confirmation.\n+          content:\n+            application/problem+json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineContextChangedProblem'\n+        '422':\n+          description: Current public machine exists but is not selectable\n+          content:\n+            application/problem+json:\n+              schema:\n+                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+              example:\n+                code: MACHINE_NOT_SELECTABLE\n+                message: This machine is not currently available for selection.\n+                retryable: false\n+                correlationId: 01JEXAMPLE0000000000000000\n+        '503':\n+          $ref: '#/components/responses/TemporaryUnavailable'\n+components:\n+  securitySchemes:\n+    bearerAuth:\n+      type: http\n+      scheme: bearer\n+      bearerFormat: AccessToken\n+  parameters:\n+    MachineId:\n+      name: machineId\n+      in: path\n+      required: true\n+      schema:\n+        $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineId'\n+    Limit:\n+      name: limit\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      schema:\n+        type: integer\n+        minimum: 1\n+        maximum: 100\n+        default: 20\n+    Cursor:\n+      name: cursor\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      description: >-\n+        Opaque signed continuation token. It is valid only with the discovery\n+        context that created it and must not be parsed by clients.\n+      schema:\n+        type: string\n+        minLength: 16\n+        maxLength: 2048\n+    Latitude:\n+      name: latitude\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      description: Must be supplied together with longitude.\n+      schema:\n+        type: number\n+        format: double\n+        minimum: -90\n+        maximum: 90\n+    Longitude:\n+      name: longitude\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      description: Must be supplied together with latitude.\n+      schema:\n+        type: number\n+        format: double\n+        minimum: -180\n+        maximum: 180\n+    North:\n+      name: north\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      description: Viewport fields must be supplied as one complete set.\n+      schema:\n+        type: number\n+        minimum: -90\n+        maximum: 90\n+    East:\n+      name: east\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      schema:\n+        type: number\n+        minimum: -180\n+        maximum: 180\n+    South:\n+      name: south\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      schema:\n+        type: number\n+        minimum: -90\n+        maximum: 90\n+    West:\n+      name: west\n+      in: query\n+      required: false\n+      schema:\n+        type: number\n+        minimum: -180\n+        maximum: 180\n+  responses:\n+    ValidationError:\n+      description: Request validation failed\n+      content:\n+        application/problem+json:\n+          schema:\n+            $ref: '#/components/schemas/ValidationProblem'\n+    AuthenticationError:\n+      description: Access session is missing, invalid, expired, or revoked\n+      content:\n+        application/problem+json:\n+          schema:\n+            $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+          example:\n+            code: AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED\n+            message: Authentication is required.\n+            retryable: false\n+            correlationId: 01JEXAMPLE0000000000000000\n+    MachineNotFound:\n+      description: >-\n+        Uniform response for unknown, hidden, archived, deleted, non-customer,\n+        inaccessible, disabled-alias, and unmapped identifiers.\n+      content:\n+        application/problem+json:\n+          schema:\n+            $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+          example:\n+            code: MACHINE_NOT_FOUND\n+            message: Machine not found.\n+            retryable: false\n+            correlationId: 01JEXAMPLE0000000000000000\n+    DiscoveryContextStale:\n+      description: Catalog ordering changed; discard cursor and refresh safely\n+      content:\n+        application/problem+json:\n+          schema:\n+            $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+          example:\n+            code: DISCOVERY_CONTEXT_STALE\n+            message: The machine list changed. Refresh to continue.\n+            retryable: true\n+            correlationId: 01JEXAMPLE0000000000000000\n+    TemporaryUnavailable:\n+      description: Catalog or availability dependency is temporarily unavailable\n+      headers:\n+        Retry-After:\n+          schema:\n+            type: integer\n+            minimum: 1\n+      content:\n+        application/problem+json:\n+          schema:\n+            $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+          example:\n+            code: DISCOVERY_TEMPORARILY_UNAVAILABLE\n+            message: Machine information is temporarily unavailable.\n+            retryable: true\n+            correlationId: 01JEXAMPLE0000000000000000\n+  schemas:\n+    MachineId:\n+      type: string\n+      pattern: '^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{22}$'\n+      description: Immutable opaque public identifier; no embedded semantics.\n+      examples:\n+        - 7mQ3LJvR9Gf2xK8pNc4YAw\n+    MachineStatus:\n+      type: string\n+      enum: [ONLINE, SERVICE, OFFLINE]\n+    Coordinates:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [latitude, longitude]\n+      properties:\n+        latitude:\n+          type: number\n+          minimum: -90\n+          maximum: 90\n+        longitude:\n+          type: number\n+          minimum: -180\n+          maximum: 180\n+    PricePerLiter:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [amountPerLiter, currency]\n+      properties:\n+        amountPerLiter:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]{1,6})?$'\n+          description: Exact positive decimal string; clients must not use binary float for comparison.\n+          examples: ['2.500000']\n+        currency:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[A-Z]{3}$'\n+          examples: [RUB]\n+    MachineSummary:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required:\n+        - machineId\n+        - displayName\n+        - address\n+        - status\n+        - machineRevision\n+      properties:\n+        machineId:\n+          $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineId'\n+        displayName:\n+          type: string\n+          minLength: 1\n+          maxLength: 120\n+        address:\n+          type: string\n+          minLength: 1\n+          maxLength: 300\n+        coordinates:\n+          $ref: '#/components/schemas/Coordinates'\n+        distanceMeters:\n+          type: integer\n+          minimum: 0\n+          description: Present only when a valid user location was supplied.\n+        price:\n+          $ref: '#/components/schemas/PricePerLiter'\n+        status:\n+          $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineStatus'\n+        machineRevision:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[1-9][0-9]*$'\n+    MachineDetail:\n+      allOf:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineSummary'\n+        - type: object\n+          additionalProperties: false\n+          required: [selectable, refreshedAt]\n+          properties:\n+            selectable:\n+              type: boolean\n+            refreshedAt:\n+              type: string\n+              format: date-time\n+    MachineCatalogPage:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [items, hasMore, catalogRevision]\n+      properties:\n+        items:\n+          type: array\n+          maxItems: 100\n+          items:\n+            $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineSummary'\n+        nextCursor:\n+          type: string\n+          description: Omitted when hasMore is false.\n+        hasMore:\n+          type: boolean\n+        catalogRevision:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[1-9][0-9]*$'\n+    ResolveMachineRequest:\n+      oneOf:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/schemas/ResolveQrRequest'\n+        - $ref: '#/components/schemas/ResolveManualRequest'\n+      discriminator:\n+        propertyName: source\n+        mapping:\n+          QR: '#/components/schemas/ResolveQrRequest'\n+          MANUAL: '#/components/schemas/ResolveManualRequest'\n+    ResolveQrRequest:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [source, value]\n+      properties:\n+        source:\n+          type: string\n+          const: QR\n+        value:\n+          type: string\n+          minLength: 1\n+          maxLength: 2048\n+          description: >-\n+            Only supported versioned trusted application addresses or explicitly\n+            approved legacy formats are parsed. Arbitrary URLs are never opened.\n+    ResolveManualRequest:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [source, value]\n+      properties:\n+        source:\n+          type: string\n+          const: MANUAL\n+        value:\n+          type: string\n+          minLength: 1\n+          maxLength: 256\n+          description: Trimmed and normalized only by the selected approved grammar.\n+    SelectionRevalidationRequest:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [expectedMachineRevision]\n+      properties:\n+        expectedMachineRevision:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[1-9][0-9]*$'\n+    MachineSelectionHandoff:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required:\n+        - machineId\n+        - machineRevision\n+        - price\n+        - availability\n+        - validatedAt\n+      properties:\n+        machineId:\n+          $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineId'\n+        machineRevision:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[1-9][0-9]*$'\n+        price:\n+          $ref: '#/components/schemas/PricePerLiter'\n+        availability:\n+          type: string\n+          const: ONLINE\n+        validatedAt:\n+          type: string\n+          format: date-time\n+    Problem:\n+      type: object\n+      additionalProperties: false\n+      required: [code, message, retryable, correlationId]\n+      properties:\n+        code:\n+          type: string\n+          pattern: '^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]+$'\n+        message:\n+          type: string\n+        retryable:\n+          type: boolean\n+        correlationId:\n+          type: string\n+    ValidationProblem:\n+      allOf:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+        - type: object\n+          additionalProperties: false\n+          properties:\n+            fields:\n+              type: array\n+              maxItems: 20\n+              items:\n+                type: object\n+                additionalProperties: false\n+                required: [field, code]\n+                properties:\n+                  field:\n+                    type: string\n+                  code:\n+                    type: string\n+    MachineContextChangedProblem:\n+      allOf:\n+        - $ref: '#/components/schemas/Problem'\n+        - type: object\n+          additionalProperties: false\n+          required: [currentMachine]\n+          properties:\n+            code:\n+              type: string\n+              const: MACHINE_CONTEXT_CHANGED\n+            retryable:\n+              type: boolean\n+              const: false\n+            currentMachine:\n+              $ref: '#/components/schemas/MachineDetail'\n+\n*** Add File: specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/quickstart.md\n+# Phase 1 Quickstart: Machine Discovery and Selection\n+\n+This is the implementation validation guide. Commands that reference machine\n+files/scripts become runnable after Phase 2 creates them; the current planning\n+command intentionally does not add production code or modify `tasks.md`.\n+\n+## Prerequisites\n+\n+- Node.js 22 and pnpm 10\n+- Docker for PostgreSQL/Redis integration tests\n+- Xcode or Android Studio plus an Expo development build for native map/camera\n+- No ERP service, credentials, database, network access, or checkout setup is\n+  required or permitted\n+\n+## Planned Setup\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm install\n+pnpm services:up\n+pnpm db:migrate\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/api machine-discovery:seed\n+pnpm dev\n+```\n+\n+The planned seed command must refuse production, reset only feature-owned fixture\n+rows, use deterministic local values, and never read `../erp-reference`.\n+\n+Install native dependencies through Expo's compatibility resolver during the\n+implementation diff:\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile exec expo install expo-location expo-camera react-native-maps\n+```\n+\n+Set development-only machine configuration in local environment (exact names are\n+to be added to the typed config schema and `.env.example`):\n+\n+```dotenv\n+MACHINE_GATEWAY_MODE=emulator\n+MACHINE_AVAILABILITY_FRESHNESS_SECONDS=60\n+MACHINE_AVAILABILITY_ALLOWED_CLOCK_SKEW_SECONDS=5\n+MACHINE_SERVICE_AREA_NORTH=56.10\n+MACHINE_SERVICE_AREA_EAST=38.20\n+MACHINE_SERVICE_AREA_SOUTH=55.40\n+MACHINE_SERVICE_AREA_WEST=36.70\n+MACHINE_CURSOR_HMAC_KEY=<local-development-secret>\n+```\n+\n+Production configuration must reject `MACHINE_GATEWAY_MODE=emulator`. Android\n+Maps credentials are deployment secrets and must not be committed.\n+\n+## Static Validation\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm lint\n+pnpm typecheck\n+pnpm build\n+pnpm openapi:generate\n+pnpm openapi:check\n+```\n+\n+Verify the generated OpenAPI includes exactly the four feature routes and that\n+response snapshots contain no internal UUID, identifier mapping, serial/modem\n+identifier, topic, credentials, raw evidence, or source metadata.\n+\n+## Backend Scenarios\n+\n+### Authentication and validation\n+\n+1. Call each route without a token and expect the standard safe `401` envelope.\n+2. Supply one coordinate without the other, incomplete viewport bounds, invalid\n+   ranges, oversized code/cursor, and malformed public IDs; expect `400` with no\n+   framework/database details.\n+3. Expire/revoke the session and confirm no cached protected catalog is returned.\n+\n+### Catalog and deterministic pagination\n+\n+1. Seed more than 20 machines, including identical-distance pairs, unpublished\n+   records, missing coordinates, and invalid/offline evidence.\n+2. Request `limit=20` with location and verify ascending Haversine distance then\n+   `machineId` tie-break.\n+3. Follow all cursors and assert no duplicate or omitted public `machineId`.\n+4. Repeat the same context and assert stable ordering.\n+5. Change price/status only and confirm ordering cursor remains valid while item\n+   projections refresh.\n+6. Change publication/location, then reuse the old cursor and expect\n+   `409 DISCOVERY_CONTEXT_STALE`, never a mixed page.\n+7. Deny location and verify configured-service-area results ordered by\n+   `machineId`, with no user distance field.\n+8. Request a viewport and verify only valid in-bounds coordinates become map\n+   results; invalid/missing coordinates never produce markers.\n+\n+### Availability and clock\n+\n+Use the deterministic clock/emulator to verify:\n+\n+| Fixture | Expected result |\n+|---|---|\n+| Fresh `READY`, reachable, ready, sales allowed, valid price | `ONLINE`, selectable |\n+| Explicit service mode with any evidence | `SERVICE`, not selectable |\n+| Explicit `OFFLINE` | `OFFLINE`, not selectable |\n+| Missing or `UNKNOWN` evidence | `OFFLINE`, not selectable |\n+| Observation exactly inside configured freshness | `ONLINE` if all other gates pass |\n+| Observation beyond freshness | `OFFLINE`, not selectable |\n+| Observation beyond allowed future skew | `OFFLINE`, not selectable |\n+| Missing/invalid price or currency | `OFFLINE`, not selectable |\n+\n+Advance the clock without a write and confirm detail/selection recomputes stale\n+evidence as offline.\n+\n+### Exact identifier resolution and disclosure safety\n+\n+1. Resolve `kaynann://machine/v1/<machineId>` and a valid current manual code.\n+2. Verify manual trim/approved case normalization and exact matching.\n+3. Test arbitrary HTTPS/custom URLs, payment-provider QR, unsupported versions,\n+   Unicode confusables, fuzzy substrings, disabled aliases, and ambiguous fixture\n+   setup; all must fail safely.\n+4. Compare unknown, hidden, archived, deleted, non-customer, inaccessible, and\n+   unmapped responses; status/body shape must be indistinguishable.\n+5. Verify production legacy resolution remains disabled without a reviewed\n+   anonymized payload and `verifiedAt` mapping.\n+\n+### Detail and selection revalidation\n+\n+1. Open a card and assert availability/publication/price are freshly projected.\n+2. Confirm an unchanged `ONLINE` revision and receive the typed handoff.\n+3. Change the price after card load; confirmation must return\n+   `MACHINE_CONTEXT_CHANGED` with fresh safe detail and no handoff.\n+4. Change status to `SERVICE`, `OFFLINE`, stale, hidden, or deleted; confirmation\n+   must not advance.\n+5. Retry the endpoint and verify it creates no purchase, reservation, wallet,\n+   dispense, MQTT, or other persistent side effect.\n+\n+Suggested targeted commands after test files exist:\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- src/machines\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test:integration -- machines\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test:e2e -- machines\n+```\n+\n+## Mobile Scenarios\n+\n+### Permission and native fallbacks\n+\n+Test iOS and Android with location/camera states `undetermined`, `granted`,\n+`denied`, `restricted`, `revoked`, and `unavailable`:\n+\n+- The list remains usable without location.\n+- The configured service area is shown when user position is unavailable.\n+- Scanner failures retain a manual-code path.\n+- Only one focused camera preview exists; leaving the route stops detections.\n+- Safe Area, keyboard, compact screens, and orientation-supported layouts do not\n+  obscure primary actions/errors.\n+\n+### State ownership and view continuity\n+\n+1. Load pages in list view, switch to map, and verify deduplicated machines,\n+   viewport/discovery context, card, and permission state are retained by the one\n+   MobX owner.\n+2. Switch back and verify there is no duplicate request solely due to rendering.\n+3. Assert screens expose no public Subject/long-lived subscription and do not\n+   mirror discovery state in React local state.\n+\n+### Concurrency and stale-response safety\n+\n+Use fake adapters and delayed Observables:\n+\n+1. Emit positions A then B with A responding last; only B may update state.\n+2. Change viewport during loading; the previous response must be ignored.\n+3. Trigger refresh during pagination; old page append must not mutate the new\n+   generation.\n+4. Scan the same QR repeatedly; only one lookup/card transition occurs in the\n+   suppression window.\n+5. Tap confirmation repeatedly; only one revalidation/navigation handoff occurs.\n+6. Log out or replace the account while every workflow type is in flight; all\n+   work is cancelled and late results cannot restore old state.\n+7. Call `dispose()` twice and assert no active subscriptions or later mutations.\n+\n+Suggested targeted command after tests exist:\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery\n+```\n+\n+## UI Comparison\n+\n+Visually compare native components against:\n+\n+- `docs/design/mockups/03_machine_selection_hd.png`\n+- `docs/design/mockups/04_machine_purchase_hd.png`\n+- `docs/design/mockups/10_qr_scanner_hd.png`\n+\n+Preserve map/list, card, scanner, spacing, hierarchy, and interaction states. Do\n+not implement or copy search, advanced filters, favorites, volume/total/purchase\n+controls, Ghana addresses, `+233`, USD, sample names/prices, fixed values, or\n+unapproved machine imagery.\n+\n+## End-to-End Acceptance Run\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm test\n+pnpm test:integration\n+pnpm test:e2e\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test:e2e\n+```\n+\n+Run device-specific camera/map permission checks separately; simulators alone do\n+not validate camera behavior. Capture first-page/detail timings under the feature\n+spec's reference network conditions and verify the 2-second/3-second targets.\n+\n+## Security Exit Checklist\n+\n+- Every endpoint uses the access-session guard.\n+- Coordinates are request-scoped and absent from persistence/logging/analytics.\n+- Cursor signatures reject tampering and query-context reuse.\n+- Public JSON/OpenAPI contains only allowlisted fields.\n+- All inaccessible machine categories share one not-found representation.\n+- QR parsing never opens arbitrary URLs.\n+- Emulator mode cannot run in production.\n+- No source/config/dependency references ERP as runtime, upstream, master,\n+  integration target, or temporary data source.\n+\n*** End Patch";
text(await tools.apply_patch(patch));
