npm-lock.yaml` only through Expo's SDK-aware resolver; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile exec expo install --check`\n+- [ ] T002 [P] Add failing native configuration assertions for foreground-only location, camera without microphone/recording permission, config plugins, and Android Maps key indirection in `apps/mobile/app.config.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- app.config.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T003 Implement the Expo config plugins and localized permission descriptions from T002 in `apps/mobile/app.config.ts`, reading the Android Maps key only from deployment environment configuration; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- app.config.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T004 [P] Add failing typed machine-discovery environment tests covering cursor secret/TTL, freshness window, default service area, emulator mode, fixture mode, and production rejection of emulator/fixture/legacy-QR modes in `apps/api/src/config/env.machine-discovery.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- env.machine-discovery.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T005 Implement the validated typed configuration from T004 in `apps/api/src/config/env.ts`, keeping production legacy QR compatibility disabled by default; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- env.machine-discovery.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T006 Document the new non-secret variables and secret injection points without sample production credentials in `.env.example` and `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/quickstart.md`; validate by rereading both files and running `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- env.machine-discovery.spec.ts`\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Phase 2: Foundational\n+\n+**Purpose**: Establish the database, domain invariants, safe public boundary, emulator, and mobile state/adapters that block every user story.\n+\n+**Critical**: Complete this phase before starting any user story.\n+\n+### Database and deterministic fixtures\n+\n+- [ ] T007 Add failing Prisma schema assertions for every entity, enum, relationship, index, exact `Decimal` money/coordinate type, and singleton `MachineCatalogState` described by the data model in `apps/api/test/machines/machine-schema.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-schema.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T008 Implement `Machine`, `MachineLocation`, `MachinePrice`, `MachineIdentifierMapping`, `MachineAvailabilityEvidence`, `MachineCatalogState`, and their enums in `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api prisma validate`\n+- [ ] T009 Create the forward-only migration with tables, foreign keys, partial/unique constraints, coordinate/price/currency checks, service-area indexes, identifier collision protection, catalog ordering revision, and a database trigger rejecting public `machineId` mutation in `apps/api/prisma/migrations/20260813000100_add_machine_discovery_catalog/migration.sql`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api prisma validate`\n+- [ ] T010 Add PostgreSQL integration tests proving immutable 22-character base64url `machineId`, current/legacy identifier collision rejection, valid latitude/longitude pairs, explicit `serviceAreaCode`, and exact decimal round trips in `apps/api/test/machines/machine-catalog-database.integration-spec.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-catalog-database.integration-spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T011 Add failing seed tests for deterministic opaque IDs, current/manual/legacy identifiers, versioned QR payloads, exact prices/currencies, coordinates, publication/service/evidence states, and refusal outside development/test in `apps/api/test/machines/seed-machine-discovery.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- seed-machine-discovery.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T012 Implement the environment-gated deterministic catalog seed from T011 in `apps/api/prisma/seed-machine-discovery.ts` and register its command in `apps/api/package.json`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- seed-machine-discovery.spec.ts`\n+\n+### Domain primitives and safe boundaries\n+\n+- [ ] T013 [P] Define public/domain enums, opaque IDs, revisions, exact money strings, latitude-then-longitude coordinates, discovery contexts, details, and typed selection handoff shapes in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/machine.types.ts` and `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/machine-discovery.types.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api build` and `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile typecheck`\n+- [ ] T014 [P] Define an injectable `ClockPort`, production system clock, and reusable fixed-clock test implementation in `apps/api/src/machines/application/ports/clock.port.ts`, `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/system-clock.ts`, and `apps/api/src/common/testing/fixed-clock.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api build`\n+- [ ] T015 Add failing boundary tests for exact decimal price/currency rules, latitude/longitude pair validation, viewport bounds, explicit service area, opaque machine IDs, and identifier length/character limits in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/machine-validation.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-validation.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T016 Implement the pure validation and normalization value functions from T015 in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/machine-validation.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-validation.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T017 Add failing table-driven tests for `ONLINE`, `SERVICE`, and fail-closed `OFFLINE` projection across missing, unknown, stale-boundary, malformed, conflicting, unreachable, not-ready, sales-disabled, invalid-price, and unpublished evidence in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/availability-projector.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- availability-projector.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T018 Implement the clock-driven availability projector with `SERVICE` precedence and no other public statuses in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/availability-projector.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- availability-projector.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T019 Add failing tests for exact identifier normalization, supported versioned customer QR grammar, malformed payloads, disabled legacy aliases, and rejection of arbitrary URLs/payment-provider QR values in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/identifier-normalizer.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- identifier-normalizer.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T020 Implement exact manual/current identifier normalization and the allowlisted versioned QR parser from T019 in `apps/api/src/machines/domain/identifier-normalizer.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- identifier-normalizer.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T021 Add failing tests for signed cursor tampering, expiry, query/service-area/position/viewport mismatch, malformed payload, sort-key validation, and ordering-revision binding in `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/signed-catalog-cursor.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- signed-catalog-cursor.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T022 Implement HMAC-signed opaque keyset cursor encode/decode using typed configuration and injected clock in `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/signed-catalog-cursor.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- signed-catalog-cursor.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T023 [P] Add failing tests for the single consumer-safe error taxonomy, correlation IDs, and redaction of database, mapping, telemetry, topic, credential, and internal-state details in `apps/api/src/machines/http/machine-error.filter.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-error.filter.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T024 Implement typed application errors and their redacting HTTP filter in `apps/api/src/machines/application/machine-application.error.ts` and `apps/api/src/machines/http/machine-error.filter.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-error.filter.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T025 Add failing response-mapper tests proving the public allowlist, localized generic display-name fallback, exact money serialization, and absence of internal UUIDs, private aliases, evidence, telemetry, topics, credentials, and raw revisions in `apps/api/src/machines/http/machine-response.mapper.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-response.mapper.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T026 Implement the allowlisted catalog/detail/context-changed response mapper from T025 in `apps/api/src/machines/http/machine-response.mapper.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-response.mapper.spec.ts`\n+\n+### Read-only infrastructure and test controls\n+\n+- [ ] T027 Define query-only `MachineRepository` and refresh-only `MachineGateway` ports with no command, reservation, purchase, dispensing, or persistence capability in `apps/api/src/machines/application/ports/machine.repository.ts` and `apps/api/src/machines/application/ports/machine-gateway.port.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api build`\n+- [ ] T028 Add failing emulator tests for mutable evidence, delayed responses, injected clock, unknown/malformed/conflicting cases, abort/unsubscribe behavior, and production startup rejection in `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/emulated-machine-gateway.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- emulated-machine-gateway.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T029 Implement the standalone read-only availability emulator from T028 in `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/emulated-machine-gateway.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- emulated-machine-gateway.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T030 Add failing tests for a separate fixture-control harness that changes exact price, publication, service mode, and evidence timing without exposing controls through production routes in `apps/api/test/machines/machine-fixture-harness.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-fixture-harness.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T031 Implement the test-only fixture-control harness from T030 in `apps/api/test/machines/machine-fixture-harness.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machine-fixture-harness.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T032 Add module boundary tests proving the existing access-session guard protects all machine controllers, only the emulator is bound outside production, production refuses emulator mode, and the gateway exposes no command capability in `apps/api/src/machines/machines.module.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machines.module.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T033 Wire Prisma, typed config, clock, repository, read-only gateway, services, controllers, guard, and error filter in `apps/api/src/machines/machines.module.ts` and import it in `apps/api/src/app.module.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- machines.module.spec.ts`\n+\n+### Mobile contracts, native seams, and single state owner\n+\n+- [ ] T034 [P] Add failing decoder/API boundary tests for all OpenAPI success/error payloads, exact money strings, correlation IDs, and typed navigation handoff in `apps/mobile/src/api/machine-discovery-api.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery-api.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T035 Implement allowlisted mobile transport contracts and Observable-first authenticated API adapter methods in `apps/mobile/src/api/machine-discovery-contracts.ts` and `apps/mobile/src/api/machine-discovery-api.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery-api.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T036 [P] Add contract tests for normalized native capability states `undetermined`, `granted`, `denied`, `restricted`, `revoked`, and `unavailable`, plus injected location/scanner/map test seams in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/native-adapters.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- native-adapters.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T037 Define disposable `LocationAdapter`, `ScannerAdapter`, and `MapAdapter` interfaces plus deterministic fakes in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/LocationAdapter.ts`, `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/ScannerAdapter.ts`, `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/MapAdapter.ts`, and `apps/mobile/src/testing/machine-discovery-native-fakes.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- native-adapters.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T038 Add failing MobX tests proving one `MachineDiscoveryStore` owns discovery context, deduplicated catalog, map/list mode, permissions, scanner, current card/detail, typed handoff, loading/error states, request generations, and session epoch in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/stores/machine-discovery.store.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery.store.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T039 Implement the observable state, computed selectors, deduplication, generation guards, session clearing, and typed transitions from T038 in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/stores/machine-discovery.store.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery.store.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T040 Create the app-scoped feature composition seam, injecting API, clock/timers, native adapters, store, and a disposable flow-service placeholder in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/machine-discovery-composition-root.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile typecheck`\n+\n+**Checkpoint**: The schema, fixtures, strict domain boundary, emulator, safe transport types, and sole mobile state owner are ready; no user-facing route or screen is yet required.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Phase 3: User Story 1 - Find Nearby Machines (Priority: P1)\n+\n+**Goal**: An authenticated customer can discover a bounded, stable catalog by foreground position or explicit service area and switch between map/list without losing context.\n+\n+**Independent Test**: Seed the controlled catalog, grant or deny foreground location through the fake adapter, call `GET /v1/machines`, then verify deterministic map/list results, pagination, fallbacks, and preserved context without using identifier resolution or selection.\n+\n+### Tests for User Story 1\n+\n+- [ ] T041 [P] [US1] Add PostgreSQL integration tests for parameterized Haversine distance, latitude-then-longitude binding, viewport filtering, exclusion of invalid map coordinates, and `(distanceMeters, machineId)` tie-breaking in `apps/api/test/machines/postgres-distance.repository.integration-spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- postgres-distance.repository.integration-spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T042 [P] [US1] Add repository integration tests for service-area fallback ordering by `machineId`, bounded limits, keyset pagination without duplicates/omissions, and request-scoped coordinates never written to storage in `apps/api/test/machines/prisma-machine.repository.integration-spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- prisma-machine.repository.integration-spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T043 [P] [US1] Add service tests for discovery validation, catalog ordering revision, signed next cursors, cursor context mismatches, public visibility, and availability projection in `apps/api/src/machines/application/discover-machines.service.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- discover-machines.service.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T044 [P] [US1] Add authenticated Supertest/OpenAPI contract tests for `GET /v1/machines`, including missing auth, location, viewport, service-area fallback, pagination, safe errors, and absence of internal fields in `apps/api/test/machines/discover-machines.e2e-spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test:e2e -- discover-machines.e2e-spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T045 [P] [US1] Add mobile tests for all location permission states, foreground-only requests, location/map unavailability, and list/manual fallback availability in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/ExpoLocationAdapter.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- ExpoLocationAdapter.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T046 [P] [US1] Add flow/store tests for `switchMap` supersession of position/viewport/refresh, cancellation of prior-generation pagination, `exhaustMap` page append, catalog deduplication, and map/list context preservation in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/services/machine-discovery-flow.discovery.spec.ts`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery-flow.discovery.spec.ts`\n+\n+### Implementation for User Story 1\n+\n+- [ ] T047 [US1] Implement the parameterized PostgreSQL Haversine and non-located keyset queries required by T041-T042 in `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/postgres/postgres-distance.repository.ts` and `apps/api/src/machines/infrastructure/postgres/prisma-machine.repository.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- postgres-distance.repository.integration-spec.ts prisma-machine.repository.integration-spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T048 [US1] Implement bounded catalog discovery, ordering-revision lookup, availability projection, signed cursor handling, and safe result assembly in `apps/api/src/machines/application/discover-machines.service.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test -- discover-machines.service.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T049 [US1] Add explicitly validated discovery query DTOs with paired coordinates, bounded viewport/limit, cursor, and service area in `apps/api/src/machines/http/dto/discover-machines-query.dto.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api build`\n+- [ ] T050 [US1] Implement the thin authenticated `GET /v1/machines` action and mapper-only response shaping in `apps/api/src/machines/http/machine-discovery.controller.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/api test:e2e -- discover-machines.e2e-spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T051 [US1] Implement normalized foreground location acquisition and list fallback across every permission/capability state in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/ExpoLocationAdapter.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- ExpoLocationAdapter.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T052 [US1] Implement the React Native Maps adapter boundary with an unavailable fallback and no retained user-location logging in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/native/ReactNativeMapAdapter.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile typecheck`\n+- [ ] T053 [US1] Implement discovery triggers, `switchMap` supersession, generation-tagged results, cancelled old pagination, `exhaustMap` append, and deduplicating store transitions in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/services/machine-discovery-flow.service.ts`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- machine-discovery-flow.discovery.spec.ts`\n+- [ ] T054 [US1] Visually inspect `docs/design/mockups/03_machine_selection_hd.png` and record only responsive hierarchy, spacing, typography, marker/card/list controls, and state-treatment observations in `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/ui-notes.md`, explicitly excluding illustrative Ghana addresses, currency, names, prices, fixed values, and unapproved machine imagery; validate by rereading `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/ui-notes.md`\n+- [ ] T055 [P] [US1] Implement presentation-only marker/map rendering for normalized coordinates, selected marker, loading, unavailable-map, and viewport callbacks in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/components/MachineMap.tsx`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile typecheck`\n+- [ ] T056 [P] [US1] Implement presentation-only, virtualized machine cards/list with exact server values, distance optionality, online/service/offline states, empty/loading/error rows, and pagination callback in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/components/MachineCard.tsx` and `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/components/MachineList.tsx`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile typecheck`\n+- [ ] T057 [US1] Add screen tests for location denied/revoked/unavailable, offline/error/empty/loading catalog, map unavailable, map/list switching, deduped pagination, and preserved viewport/context in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/screens/MachineDiscoveryScreen.spec.tsx`; verify the new test fails with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- MachineDiscoveryScreen.spec.tsx`\n+- [ ] T058 [US1] Implement the observer-wrapped, presentation-oriented discovery screen with Safe Area, responsive map/list layouts, and list/manual fallback in `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/screens/MachineDiscoveryScreen.tsx`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- MachineDiscoveryScreen.spec.tsx`\n+- [ ] T059 [US1] Add the typed discovery route without duplicating store state in React in `apps/mobile/src/navigation/MainNavigator.tsx` and update navigation assertions in `apps/mobile/src/navigation/MainNavigator.spec.tsx`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile test -- MainNavigator.spec.tsx`\n+- [ ] T060 [US1] Add an independent fixture-backed discovery journey covering location and service-area fallback, deterministic ordering, two pages, no duplicates/omissions, and map/list context preservation in `apps/mobile/e2e/machine-discovery.yaml`; verify with `pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile exec maestro test e2e/machine-discovery.yaml`\n+\n+**Checkpoint**: US1 independently delivers authenticated nearby/service-area discovery and resilient map/list browsing.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Phase 4: User Story 2 - Identify a Machine by Code (Priority: P1)\n+\n+**Goal**: An authenticated customer can resolve an exact supported QR payload or manually entered code, with all inaccessible variants failing uniformly and safely.\n+\n+**Independent Test**: Resolve deterministic current QR/manual identifiers through `POST /v1/machines/resolve`, reject arbitrary URLs and disabled/hidden/unknown aliases identically, then exercise scanner and manual fallback with duplicate detections suppressed; no discovery-list dependency is required.\n+\n+### Tests for User Story 2\n+\n+- [ ] T061 [P] [