+  error that is hidden by the API build excluding `test/`.\n+- After T124 is genuinely complete, T119 must run the complete mobile\n+  typecheck, unit/component suite, Expo dependency check, and all five Maestro\n+  journeys.\n - Physical iOS and Android validation remains required for native map tiles,\n   the live camera preview, location prompts and fallback, and focus lifecycle.\n@@\n-- Runtime Maestro validation requires a usable non-distributable E2E build,\n-  Maestro tooling/device availability, the fixture API/PostgreSQL environment,\n-  and successful bootstrap/authenticated composition-root startup.\n+- Runtime Maestro validation remains blocked on completion of the missing T124\n+  integration plus a usable fixture API/PostgreSQL environment and tooling.\n@@\n - `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/tasks.md`\n+- `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/plan.md`\n - `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/validation.md`\n-- `apps/mobile/package.json`\n-- `apps/mobile/tsconfig.json`\n-- `apps/mobile/vitest.config.ts`\n+- `apps/mobile/eas.json`\n+- `apps/mobile/src/App.tsx`\n+- `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/machine-discovery-composition-root.ts`\n - `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/testing/machine-discovery-e2e-bootstrap.ts`\n+- `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/testing/machine-discovery-e2e-bootstrap.spec.ts`\n+- `apps/api/src/app.module.ts`\n+- `apps/api/test/machines/support/machine-discovery-e2e-control.ts`\n+- `apps/api/test/machines/support/machine-discovery-e2e-control.spec.ts`\n - `apps/mobile/e2e/`\n@@\n-- Keep the next diff limited to T119 validation and fixes strictly required for\n-  those checks; do not begin performance or release-documentation tasks.\n-- Do not weaken T124 fail-closed build, endpoint, credential, or session checks\n-  to make Maestro execution easier.\n+- Keep the next diff limited to completing T124 runtime E2E infrastructure; do\n+  not begin T119, performance work, or release-documentation tasks.\n+- As