otstrap, host, or routes.\n+\n+## Next Single Diff\n+\n+- Complete only `T119`; do not start performance, legacy QR, or release\n+  documentation tasks.\n+- Resolve the eight existing mobile test-only type errors, then run the complete\n+  mobile typecheck, unit/component suite, and Expo dependency check.\n+- Start the test-only API host and a non-distributable E2E mobile build with the\n+  exact fixture origin/control variables, then execute all five authored\n+  Maestro journeys.\n+- Record commands, environment prerequisites, and results in\n+  `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/validation.md`; update `tasks.md`\n+  and this handoff only when T119 is genuinely complete, then stop.\n+\n+## Latest Relevant Validation\n+\n+```bash\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile exec vitest run src/machine-discovery/testing/machine-discovery-e2e-bootstrap.spec.ts\n+# passed: 1 file, 12 tests\n+\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/api exec vitest run test/machines/support/machine-discovery-e2e-control.spec.ts\n+# passed: 1 file, 10 tests\n+\n+pnpm exec eslint --max-warnings=0 <T124 mobile source and test files>\n+# passed\n+\n+pnpm exec eslint --max-warnings=0 <T124 API source and test files>\n+# passed\n+\n+EAS_BUILD_PROFILE=machine-discovery-e2e APP_ENV=e2e \\\n+  EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=e2e \\\n+  EXPO_PUBLIC_BUILD_VARIANT=machine-discovery-e2e \\\n+  EXPO_PUBLIC_PRODUCTION_DISTRIBUTABLE=false \\\n+  node apps/mobile/scripts/select-machine-discovery-entry.mjs\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile exec expo export --platform android \\\n+  --output-dir /private/tmp/knn-t124-e2e-hook-export-2\n+# passed: Metro bundled apps/mobile/index.e2e.ts, 1159 modules\n+\n+APP_ENV=production EAS_BUILD_PROFILE=production \\\n+  node apps/mobile/scripts/select-machine-discovery-entry.mjs\n+# passed: apps/mobile/package.json main restored to index.ts\n+\n+APP_ENV=e2e node apps/mobile/scripts/select-machine-discovery-entry.mjs\n+# expected rejection: exact non-distributable EAS profile is required\n+\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/mobile typecheck\n+# non-zero only for 8 existing test-only errors in\n+# MachineResponsiveLayout.spec.tsx and\n+# machine-discovery-flow.stale-results.spec.ts\n+\n+pnpm --filter @kaynann/api typecheck\n+# non-zero only for 15 existing errors in prior machine test files; no T124 errors\n+```\n+\n+## Validation Still Needed\n+\n+- T119 must make the complete mobile typecheck green and run the full mobile\n+  unit/component suite plus `expo install --check`.\n+- T119 must execute all five Maestro journeys against the runnable E2E mobile\n+  build and fixture API/PostgreSQL environment and record the results.\n+- The E2E runtime requires explicit fixture-only values for the API origin,\n+  allowed origins, and control credential; do not persist credentials in source\n+  or `eas.json`.\n+- Physical iOS and Android validation remains required for native map tiles,\n+  the live camera preview, location prompts and fallback, and focus lifecycle.\n+- Performance, legacy QR, interaction-trial, and final release validation remain\n+  for `T120-T123`, `T125`, and `T128-T129`.\n+\n+## Files To Read On Resume\n+\n+- `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/tasks.md`\n+- `specs/006-machine-discovery-and-selection/validation.md`\n+- `apps/mobile/package.json`\n+- `apps/mobile/eas.json`\n+- `apps/mobile/scripts/select-machine-discovery-entry.mjs`\n+- `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/screens/MachineResponsiveLayout.spec.tsx`\n+- `apps/mobile/src/machine-discovery/services/machine-discovery-flow.stale-results.spec.ts`\n+- `apps/mobile/e2e/`\n+- `apps/api/test/machines/support/machine-discovery-e2e-host.ts`\n+- `apps/api/test/machines/support/machine-discovery-e2e-server.ts`\n+\n+## Constraints And Risks\n+\n+- Keep the next diff limited to T119 and one logical validation change; do not\n+  begin T120 or later work.\n+- Keep `apps/mobile/package.json` on `main: index.ts` outside the exact E2E build\n+  hook invocation.\n+- Do not weaken fail-closed build, endpoint, credential, session, fixture-data,\n+  or production-registration checks to make Maestro execution easier.\n+- Preserve T115 fail-closed production gates, read-only repository/gateway\n+  boundaries, and the existing staging policy.\n+- Do not introduce schema, dependency, auth, or security-sensitive changes\n+  without approval.\n+- Never modify the read-only ERP reference repository.\n*** End Patch";
